			"Message": "fix: Exclude large files exceeding GitHub's 100MB limit from git\n\n- Update .gitattributes to only track files under 100MB with LFS\n- Update .gitignore to exclude DMG files (100-102MB) and .app bundles with node (105MB)\n- These files exceed GitHub's hard limit and cannot be pushed even with LFS\n- Use GitHub Releases for distributing large binaries\n\nRemoved from tracking:\n- Target/debug/bundle/dmg/*.dmg (100-102 MB)\n- Target/debug/bundle/macos/*.app (contains 105MB node binary)",
